# Sonique — Agent Context File
# This file tells the AI agent everything it needs to know about this project.
# Read this BEFORE touching any code.

## 1. What Is This Project?
Sonique is a **Kotlin Multiplatform (KMP) music player app** targeting Android (primary) and JVM Desktop.
It is a YouTube Music / Spotify client — it scrapes YTMusic via a custom scraper module and can also
authenticate with Spotify for lyrics and canvas videos. It supports local playback, lyrics (multiple
providers), podcasts, playlists, albums, artists, canvas videos, and a full library system with
offline support, crossfade playback, sponsor block, and pitch/speed controls.

The app is under active development. The user works feature-by-feature and expects clean,
production-quality Kotlin/Compose Multiplatform code with NO shortcuts.


