| `:spotify`                  | `core/service/spotify/`                               | Spotify integration (lyrics, canvas, auth)             |
| `:lyricsService`            | `core/service/lyricsService/`                         | Lyrics fetching (LrcLib, YouTube)                      |
| `:ktorExt`                  | `core/service/ktorExt/`                               | Ktor HTTP client extensions                            |
| `:media3`                   | `core/media/media3/`                                  | Media3 (ExoPlayer) integration — Android playback      |
| `:media3-ui`                | `core/media/media3-ui/`                               | Media3 UI components                                   |
| `:mediaserviceinterfaces`   | `MediaServiceCore/mediaserviceinterfaces/`            | Media service interfaces (shared contracts)            |
| `:youtubeapi`               | `MediaServiceCore/youtubeapi/`                        | Raw YouTube Data API / InnerTube calls                 |
| `:googleapi`                | `MediaServiceCore/googleapi/`                         | Google auth API                                        |
| `:sharedutils`              | `MediaServiceCore/SharedModules/sharedutils/`         | Shared utility helpers                                 |

> **Note**: `core/media/media-jvm/` and `core/media/media-jvm-ui/` exist for JVM Desktop playback
> (GStreamer-based). The JVM MediaPlayerHandler is in `core/data/src/jvmMain/`.


